==============================================================================
   ratio R  #tested   safe=0 (no decorr)     min safe
    (2, 3)      398                    0      0.04192
    (3, 5)      400                    0      0.05025
    (5, 8)      400                    0      0.05257
   (8, 13)      400                    0      0.06455
