==============================================================================
  n=7 gap member [1, 5, 6, 11, 16, 17]: safe(2/13) = 0 (=0: it's a gap member, floor FAILS at n=7)
  n=7 AP {1..6}: safe(2/13) = 0 (=0: M(AP6)=1/7 < 2/13, the tiler)
